   "lines": [
    "Rode with Annie",
    "Murray to Syosset",
    "and down Laurel",
    "Hollow; and took",
    "her out in the",
    "row boat. She is",
    "a singularly",
    "sweet and lady",
    "like girl; and",
    "very pretty and",
    "clever. She",
    "goes away",
    "to-morrow"
   ],
